  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Wearing a suit for job interviews, a young crew Student runs into a former actress from the team who now enjoys steady office work, before rushing back to learn that their master tape is gone. Listen for \"jimu sagyou\", office clerical work.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "へえ、みんなで資金集めか。それでスーツ着てんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そうなんです、もう大変で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "相変わらず落ち着きのない集団だね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "今は普通の仕事を？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "そう、事務作業。地味な仕事だけどちゃんと認めてくれてさ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すごく生き生きしててきれいです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "そろそろ会社戻らないとだ。みんなにもよろしく言っといて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "今度飲みにでも行きませんか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ちょっと何やってんの？さっさと次の現場行くよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "何、もうくじけちゃったの？そんなんじゃお金集まんないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "いや、それどころじゃないんですよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "マスターテープがないんですよね。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "へえ、みんなで資金集めか。それでスーツ着てんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, so you are all raising funds. That explains why you are wearing a suit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そうなんです、もう大変で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, it has been really rough.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "相変わらず落ち着きのない集団だね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still the same restless bunch as ever, huh.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "今は普通の仕事を？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you work an ordinary job now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "そう、事務作業。地味な仕事だけどちゃんと認めてくれてさ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, office clerical work. It is plain work, yet people appreciate me properly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すごく生き生きしててきれいです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You look so vibrant and radiant.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "そろそろ会社戻らないとだ。みんなにもよろしく言っといて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I need to head back to the office soon. Say hello to everyone for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "今度飲みにでも行きませんか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you like to go out for a drink sometime?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ちょっと何やってんの？さっさと次の現場行くよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, what are you doing? Let's hurry to the next side job.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "何、もうくじけちゃったの？そんなんじゃお金集まんないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What, discouraged already? We won't raise money like that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "いや、それどころじゃないんですよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, it is way worse than that right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "マスターテープがないんですよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The master tape is missing.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
